## Operational Guidance

- **Act on tool results rather than relaying them.** When a tool returns data, use it; do not restate the payload to the user before continuing.
- **Long-context habit.** Content already in this conversation counts as retrieved — reference it instead of re-reading the same file or re-running the same command.
- Characteristic drift under a long context: summarising an entire large input when only two lines of it matter. Extract, then act.
